"Contact Pigeon Express and request API access (e-mail "
"support@pigeonexpress.com, or via pigeonexpress.com)."
msgstr ""
"Свържете се с Pigeon Express и заявете API достъп (имейл "
"support@pigeonexpress.com или чрез pigeonexpress.com)."

#: includes/Admin/class-bgc-settings.php:485
