"Sameday issues API credentials (username + password) to clients after a "
"business contract."
msgstr ""
"Sameday издава API данни за достъп (потребителско име + парола) на клиенти "
"след сключване на бизнес договор."

#: includes/Admin/class-bgc-settings.php:509
msgid ""
"Sign a Sameday business contract (via sameday.bg or your Sameday account "
